WEBVTT

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.910
A high school airsoft tournament!

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:13.990
I brought a ton of candy, too!

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.000
Good thinkin'!

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:20.650
"Advance."

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.350
"Stop."

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.610
"Fire." And then...

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:27.040
"Sniper" was...

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:29.840
"Sniper" was this.

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.260
Oh, right!

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:34.340
We're here!

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:37.680
Those are the tournament grounds!

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.310
