00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:40.720
High School Airsoft Tournament

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:50.430
Whoah, this place is packed!

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:52.690
More girls have been joining in lately.

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:58.620
I wish our school had this many airsoft players.

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:01.750
So these are airsoft skirmish grounds!

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:21.190
STELLA GIRLS' ACADEMY

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:21.190
HIGH SCHOOL DIVISION C  CLUB

00:01:21.650 --> 00:01:24.550
I decided this myself

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:27.560
I decided that relying on chance

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:33.070
is just so ridiculously fruitless

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:38.040
I dwelled in my fantasies too much

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:44.010
I'm going to leave my safety zone behind

00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:48.880
The future is opening up to me like a vast river

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:53.180
Even if sailing straight is difficult,

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:56.510
I will hold my head high

00:01:57.390 --> 00:02:00.170
I'll change my life,

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:03.210
and the gray rules that govern it

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:09.070
even if I trip and stumble on the way

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:14.990
Others are guiding me, but I will walk

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:21.870
My footprints in this world are so colorful

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:45.510
Do the enemy bullets break even your spirit?

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:49.440
Is there really a hot spring nearby?

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:51.150
Yeah. The view's great.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.880
I love their outdoor bath.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:52.060
Right from the source !

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:52.060
15 minutes on foot
from grounds

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:52.060
Direct bus
from nearest train station

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:52.060
Soak in the water and
heal your weary bodies!

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:57.280
Natural Hot Spring Inn

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:57.280
Kakusui Inn

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.890
Team badge?

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:02.270
Each team has their own badge to help us tell each other apart.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.740
Put it on your arm like this.

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:07.080
Here, Bunnyura.

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:11.040
Thank you.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:26.060
Today's Airsoft Skirm

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:16.240
Let me make sure everyone knows the rules for today.

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:19.750
In this skirmish, we have to grab the enemy's flag from their starting area,

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:25.050
or, alternatively, wipe them all out to win the battle.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:30.030
Oh, Yurara, this is your first time in a big tournament, right?

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:31.940
Maybe we should tie your hair up so it doesn't get in the way?

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:36.300
Uh, maybe...

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:39.780
What about this?

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.900
No way, this!

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:44.200
I think this is pretty good!

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:46.280
I think we have a winner!

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:48.400
This is the last one!

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:51.790
Um...

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.000
Yurarin,

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:57.430
just keep it as is if you want to.

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:58.330
Here.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.030
Okay!

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:04.590
We will now begin the first game.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:07.910
Teams, please take your positions.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.520
All right!

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:13.480
Let's crush them under our boots!

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.250
That's too rough!

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:17.520
H-How about...

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:20.530
"Let's have fun and win"?

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:23.400
Oh, that's not bad.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:24.490
Let's go with that.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.780
C3 club, move out!

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.780
Let's have fun...

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:31.790
And win!

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:41.740
<i>My heart's racing.</i>

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:44.480
<i>Will I be able to hit anyone?</i>

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:46.010
Don't worry.

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:48.400
I'll protect the flag.

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:49.680
You go attack and have fun.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:01.510
Five...

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:02.700
Four...

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:03.360
Three...

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:04.700
What the—

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:05.700
Two...

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:06.990
A grenade?

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:07.940
One.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:15.460
Hell yeah, the flag's mine!

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:18.540
U-Um...

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:21.090
Advance, Bunnyura!

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.910
Need backup! Main entrance!

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:28.090
Eat this!

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:32.220
Hit!

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.770
Nice, Kari!

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:44.150
<i>All right!</i>

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.060
Hey, up here!

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:48.650
Damn you!

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:56.000
<i>Advance while their attention is on Karira!</i>

00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:58.620
<i>Go, Yurara!</i>

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:01.380
<i>They're going to hit Kari.</i>

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:05.380
<i>No, no. She's bait!</i>

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:13.860
Hit.

00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:14.910
No way.

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:16.240
Yay!

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:18.340
Yay!

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:20.560
I'm sorry for shooting you!

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.020
<i>Why's she apologizing to the enemy?</i>

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:28.740
Yurara, we're in a skirmish now, so there's really no reason to apologize.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:30.530
I'm sorry!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:33.450
Well, you did good.

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:49.300
<i>Three on one, huh?</i>

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:54.100
I like it.

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:22.880
H-Hit.

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:33.890
<i>It's close enough that even Yurara could grab it.</i>

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:35.090
<i>Go!</i>

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:36.600
<i>The flag's right there!</i>

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:39.510
There's the flag...

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:42.600
<i>But should I really be the one...</i>

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:47.270
<i>This person's good.</i>

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:50.780
<i>Go, Yurara!</i>

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:52.360
<i>I'll cover you!</i>

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:54.620
<i>Hono...</i>

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:59.290
<i>I-I'm going...</i>

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:09.130
Go for it!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:16.970
Hooray!

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:22.390
This might just be the time of my life!

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:25.480
Nice job, Yurarin.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:27.940
Gee, thanks!

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:30.400
You had your share of newbie luck.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:31.520
Don't be so harsh.

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:35.030
She moved pretty well out there for a newbie, don't you think?

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:38.990
I was much faster than I thought I'd be!

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:41.610
The next match's gonna start.

00:08:41.610 --> 00:08:44.540
Reload your gun and get something to drink.

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:46.540
Okay.

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:12.610
We will now have an hour-long lunch break.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.110
Finally, a break.

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.440
It's been a long day!

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:21.300
A single match is only 15 minutes, though.

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:24.820
It was still a year's worth of exercise for me.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:25.460
Team
Lunch

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:25.460
Homemade

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:25.460
Curry

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:29.330
There's nothing like curry after a skirm!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:26.540
Team
Lunch

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:26.540
Homemade

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:26.540
Curry

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:32.430
It's spicy, but oh so good!

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:35.840
Here's the tea and candy.

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:42.140
I looked at the brackets, and our next opponent is Meisei Girls' Academy.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.560
What?

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:45.560
Are they good?

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.580
Good? They're demonic.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.560
Demonic?!

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:52.540
We've fought them four times so far, and we've always ended in a draw.

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:54.720
We haven't beaten them once.

00:09:54.720 --> 00:10:00.070
Their leader is Haruna Rin, and she's super good.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:03.330
Haruna Rin...

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:09.390
She even fought together with Sono when they were in America.

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:16.930
I've never won against her, but her skills are the only good thing about her.

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:20.720
You couldn't pay me to team up with her.

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:25.270
<i>I wonder what kind of person she is.</i>

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:32.780
I'll go get some water.

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:34.780
I-I'll go too!

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:34.820
Lockers

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:34.820
Water Station

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:53.190
Thanks, Sono—

00:10:58.410 --> 00:10:59.610
Long time no see.

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:09.050
Long time no see?

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:24.720
Hey, this is our newest member.

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:25.640
Cute, huh?

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:28.130
As are you.

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:31.870
But be it in the past, present, or future,

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:35.100
you shall not be forgiven.

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:40.290
Um...

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:41.680
what was that about?

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:01.450
We'll try to break through their flank in this match.

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:03.160
It'll be an all-out blitzkrieg!

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:06.240
B-Blitzkrieg?

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:09.510
Yay! We're finally attacking!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.490
A fitting strategy for us.

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:17.870
We normally split our forces between defending the flag and attacking,

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:20.910
but if we do that with a newbie like Yurara around,

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:19.880
1234123412341234Meisei12341234123412

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:24.100
we're bound to get crushed.

00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:26.170
But if we all storm their position,

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:28.420
we'll have a shot even if they attempt to surround us.

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:31.120
That's why we're carrying out a swift, focused attack.

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:31.730
That's all.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:35.020
Let's make them eat dust!

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:36.750
Do you think...

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:39.800
I can do it?

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:41.780
Don't worry about winning or losing.

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:44.480
We're here to have fun, remember?

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:57.020
<i>I guess I'm on the attack, too...</i>

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:57.710
<i>An enemy?!</i>

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.360
<i>What're you doing, Li'l Yura?</i>

00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:00.640
<i>Move!</i>

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:01.640
<i>No, no!</i>

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:03.170
<i>The enemy's here!</i>

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:04.300
Take cover, Kari!

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:07.130
Hit.

00:13:07.130 --> 00:13:08.550
Hacchan?

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:09.810
Hit.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.290
You too, Ren?

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:30.410
Holy Moses.

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:36.620
Yurara!

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:39.420
Don't space out. Stay focused.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.380
O-Okay.

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:48.890
<i>A swift attack on our flank.</i>

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:52.970
<i>They're trying to babysit her during an all-out assault...</i>

00:13:57.280 --> 00:13:58.170
Karira!

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:01.370
Hit.

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.150
You don't let up.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.800
<i>What should we do?</i>

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:13.710
<i>They'll reach our flag soon.</i>

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:16.680
<i>I'll take care of Rin.</i>

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:17.660
<i>Get moving.</i>

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:20.630
<i>She's telling us to move, but...</i>

00:14:22.850 --> 00:14:24.520
<i>I-I can't do it...</i>

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:26.690
<i>How am I supposed to slip out of here?</i>

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:27.420
Let's go.

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:32.670
W-Wait!

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:40.520
Come closer, Sonora.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.120
Yurara!

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:05.730
It's my fault!

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:07.800
I was too slow!

00:15:08.770 --> 00:15:10.470
Now they got Sono!

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:15.030
This is strange.

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:17.720
It should be a walk in the park to capture our flag.

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:24.910
<i>I can't do it.</i>

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:27.230
<i>I can't do it alone.</i>

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:30.240
<i>I'm scared!</i>

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:35.920
Rin.

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:37.770
Stella are down to one girl.

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:39.250
Let's capture the flag and end this.

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:42.250
Yes! Please end it!

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:44.130
Ignore the flag.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.750
What? But...

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:48.760
We shall put the entire C3 club to the sword.

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:51.030
Go.

00:15:51.030 --> 00:15:51.760
Roger.

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:53.510
It's not over...

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:57.310
They're looking... for me!

00:15:58.460 --> 00:15:59.630
I have to run!

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:08.010
Oh, no!

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:09.260
They've found me!

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.510
I-I surrender.

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:36.890
I'm dropping out.

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:47.770
Is it over?

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:53.420
Stella Girls' Academy's C3 club has dropped out,
so Meisei Girls' Academy is declared the winner.

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:55.990
What did he say? Dropped out?

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:58.680
That's what I heard!

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:08.670
Why did you not fight until the end?

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:11.990
You lack the resolve for airsoft.

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:16.680
That sort of attitude absolutely disgusts me.

00:17:18.240 --> 00:17:20.070
Why do you fight?

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:22.350
I...

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:25.690
You have no right to take part in airsoft.

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:29.710
Hey, Rin.

00:17:30.260 --> 00:17:32.150
What're you telling our Li'l Yura?

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:35.430
Excuse me.

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:37.150
Hold it!

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:41.020
Jeez...

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:44.620
You're better off not listenin' to her.

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:45.760
Yeah!

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:47.740
There's always a next time.

00:17:47.740 --> 00:17:49.610
Don't mind her.

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:55.890
Come on, say something, Sono.

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:58.260
Sono...

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.370
Rin's right.

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:04.850
You wasted the sacrifices your friends made and deserted.

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:10.030
Someone who can't fight alone can't fight on a team.

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:12.650
Put on a smile even when you're shot down.

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:16.400
Don't be afraid of losing.

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:19.700
And never pull this shit again.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:39.560
Anyway, let's go take a bath!

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:45.600
This is your only chance to see Hono without her glasses!

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:49.690
I could look at her naked body forever.

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:53.440
Makes up for our little shrimp, I'd say.

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:56.150
What'd you say?

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:58.690
Who's a shrimp?!

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:02.160
Stop it.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:09.250
Karira, you're not allowed to jump in.

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:12.360
Come on, lay off.

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:14.710
I wonder what's wrong.

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:22.130
Excitement will cheer her up!

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:23.830
I know it will!

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:31.810
Check these out!

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:34.310
These are the medals I got today!

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:40.830
Yurara.

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:42.660
Yes?

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:47.060
I know you're letting what happened today get to you even though I told you not to,

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:53.540
but being told to never do something again means you're being given another chance.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:57.480
Yeah, don't worry about it!

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:58.690
Yes.

00:19:58.690 --> 00:19:59.430
I'm...

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:02.710
I'm sorry for making you worry.

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:10.730
<i>You wasted the sacrifices your friends made...</i>

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:13.470
<i>And deserted.</i>

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:18.060
<i>I thought I could change if my environment did.</i>

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:22.700
<i>I thought I could definitely change if I joined the C3 club.</i>

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:24.320
<i>But...</i>

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:27.500
<i>I still just relied on others!</i>

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:31.500
<i>Where did I go wrong?</i>

00:20:57.140 --> 00:21:00.690
<i>Just keep it as is if you want to.</i>

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:03.900
<i>I want to stay as is...</i>

00:21:05.670 --> 00:21:06.740
<i>with everyone...</i>

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:09.030
<i>so...</i>

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:10.990
<i>I...</i>

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.000
<i>need to change right now!</i>

00:21:17.030 --> 00:21:18.530
Yurara?

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:29.430
Thanks!

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:31.430
G-Goodness!

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:33.730
What went wrong, Yuracchi?

00:21:34.130 --> 00:21:36.190
You're more of a Boyura now!

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:40.690
I'll be serious about airsoft!

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:41.940
I won't run away!

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:46.650
Huh?

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:48.950
That's so cute, Yurarin!

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:50.450
I can't take it!

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:51.740
Thanks.

00:21:52.380 --> 00:21:53.700
All right!

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:57.070
Now's when it really starts, Li'l Yura.

00:21:57.070 --> 00:21:58.460
Oh, right.

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:00.560
No funny names anymore.

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:02.710
Just call me Yura, please.

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:05.300
Got it, Yura.

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:09.120
I'll do my best.

00:22:09.780 --> 00:22:10.680
Command!

00:22:11.360 --> 00:22:12.560
Control!

00:22:13.020 --> 00:22:14.810
Communication!

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:15.880
The C3 Club!

00:22:15.880 --> 00:22:16.500
Yay!

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:19.700
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:22:19.700 --> 00:22:23.060
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:22:23.060 --> 00:22:28.160
Smile, 'cause isn't this fun?

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:30.240
Yay!

00:22:31.400 --> 00:22:36.410
I blush when I make eye contact with my comrade,

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:38.220
but that's fine

00:22:38.220 --> 00:22:41.350
Let's trust each other and laugh

00:22:41.350 --> 00:22:42.340
Ready?

00:22:42.910 --> 00:22:44.860
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:44.860 --> 00:22:47.890
Take your comrade and get the flag!

00:22:47.890 --> 00:22:51.610
Can't you feel your heart thump when you advance?

00:22:51.610 --> 00:22:54.690
Let's hit them and laugh

00:22:54.690 --> 00:22:55.600
All right?

00:22:56.270 --> 00:22:58.240
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:58.240 --> 00:23:01.570
It can be hard, it can be vexing,

00:23:01.570 --> 00:23:04.400
but when you overcome that

00:23:04.720 --> 00:23:11.510
you'll smile like you never did before

00:23:11.510 --> 00:23:13.230
Everyone, take up positions!

00:23:13.230 --> 00:23:13.750
Okay!

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:18.220
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:23:18.220 --> 00:23:21.370
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:25.560
Enjoy your youth, even if your tears are stolen

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:31.480
Telepathy, a step forward

00:23:31.480 --> 00:23:34.550
Don't look down, look ahead

00:23:34.850 --> 00:23:35.750
Sorry it took me so long to be enthusiastic about it!

00:23:39.810 --> 00:24:09.670
Preview

00:23:41.110 --> 00:23:44.180
That hairstyle suits you so well, Yura.

00:23:44.180 --> 00:23:45.560
Thanks!

00:23:45.560 --> 00:23:46.820
Maybe I should cut mine too.

00:23:46.820 --> 00:23:48.160
That'd be such a waste!

00:23:48.160 --> 00:23:49.780
You have natural blonde hair!

00:23:49.780 --> 00:23:51.350
Um... okay. I won't, then.

00:23:51.350 --> 00:23:52.630
I'll cut mine, then.

00:23:52.630 --> 00:23:53.250
Huh?!

00:23:53.250 --> 00:23:55.530
But yours is so beautiful, Ren!

00:23:55.530 --> 00:23:56.600
It's so long and silky!

00:23:56.600 --> 00:23:57.740
I'm so jealous!

00:23:57.740 --> 00:23:59.650
I cut it every day, though.

00:23:59.650 --> 00:24:00.660
Huh?!

00:24:00.660 --> 00:24:09.760
You have to hit with arrows you don't have.

00:24:00.660 --> 00:24:01.390
Next episode.

00:24:01.390 --> 00:24:03.170
You have to hit with arrows you don't have.

00:24:03.170 --> 00:24:04.100
What about you, Sono?

00:24:04.100 --> 00:24:06.230
My hair doesn't grow.

00:24:06.230 --> 00:24:07.630
Huh?!
